2026-10-29, paired runs (25 each, alternating, same interpreter; `evals/core-v2/measure-optimise-20261029.json`),
before and after the entry/runtime split:

| | Before | After |
|---|---|---|
| UserPromptSubmit, lite | 59.0 ms | 54.5 ms |
| PreToolUse Read / Bash | 53.1 / 59.4 ms | 46.9 / 52.1 ms |
| PostToolUse Bash | 57.0 ms | 49.5 ms |
| Always-loaded rule file | 6,303 B | 6,303 B (`test_core_v2` caps it at 6,600 B; growing past it means cutting first, which is the user's call) |

